silm:instances_papers_09_minimal_category_theory_chapters_03_functors_and_natural_transformations_sections_01_functors_yoneda_hom_leg_2_aboutness_leg silm:hasExample "In 'S01FunctorsYonedaHomLeg2', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, the VetRecord77 -> Mittens aboutness leg; an information arrow, not an isomorphism" .
